{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-6-17","kind":"proposition","title":"三直线为连比例即首尾两线矩内直角形与中线上直角方形等首尾线矩内直角形与中线…","englishTitle":"If three straight lines be proportional, the rectangle contained by the extremes is equal to the square on the mean; and, if the rectangle contained by the extremes be equal to the square on the mean, the three straight lines will be proportional.","book":6,"number":17,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.17","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.17/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":17,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-6-17@raw-21415b156e72ad10","contentId":"euclid-6-17","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"21415b156e72ad1062037297bd654df9e9a43e2280f29ca78f84af5f795e902f","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-6-17.statement","euclid-6-17.construction.1","euclid-6-17.construction.2","euclid-6-17.proof.1","euclid-6-17.proof.2","euclid-6-17.proof.3","euclid-6-17.proof.4","euclid-6-17.proof.5","euclid-6-17.proof.6","euclid-6-17.proof.7","euclid-6-17.proof.8","euclid-6-17.proof.9","euclid-6-17.conclusion","euclid-6-17.historical.1","euclid-6-17.historical.2","euclid-6-17.historical.3","euclid-6-17.historical.4","euclid-6-17.historical.5","euclid-6-17.historical.6","euclid-6-17.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-6-17.statement","contentId":"euclid-6-17","revisionId":"euclid-6-17@raw-21415b156e72ad10","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e4b30cdfebd7fa6211609831de5a0a4f493fdb6d768b50e63c9c43afa6350afa","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If three straight lines be proportional, the rectangle contained by the extremes is equal to the square on the mean; and, if the rectangle contained by the extremes be equal to the square on the mean, the three straight lines will be proportional."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果三个直线是成比例, 由极端组成的矩形等于平均值的正方形;如果由极端组成的矩形等于平均值的正方形, 则三条直线将是成比例。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"三直线为连比例即首尾两线矩内直角形与中线上直角方形等首尾线矩内直角形与中线上直角方形等即三线为连比例"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"三条直线是连接比，即首尾两条直线内的矩形等于中线上的正方形。头尾直线内的矩形时距等于中线上的正方形，即三条直线是连续比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-17.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-6-17","revisionId":"euclid-6-17@raw-21415b156e72ad10","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1218a7ee1b94d604778af49f151ddfa168f972424e8d1000334905ae7a3c6e72","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the three straight lines A, B, C be proportional, so that, as A is to B, so is B to C; I say that the rectangle contained by A, C is equal to the square on B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让这三条直线A,B,C为成比例,A对B的比例等于B对C的比例;我说,A对C形成的矩形等于B对正方形；A 与 B 之比等于 B 与 C 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-17.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-6-17","revisionId":"euclid-6-17@raw-21415b156e72ad10","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"01486d179eed001e1bf284f2fa6b82e4f455759a1f4419e783dd96552fbca70d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let D be made equal to B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让D等于B"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-17.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-6-17","revisionId":"euclid-6-17@raw-21415b156e72ad10","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ce2702343e8b7c3c391c6fedce72febe150d59d52bde4a1ccda9eae7c73a8e82","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since, as A is to B, so is B to C, and B is equal to D, therefore, as A is to B, so is D to C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A对B的比等于B对C的比,B等于D,因此,A对B的比等于D对C的比；A 与 B 之比等于 B 与 C 之比；A 与 B 之比等于 D 与 C 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-17.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-6-17","revisionId":"euclid-6-17@raw-21415b156e72ad10","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"446285290da01ced2dba03ac95f4751112515513bbd6e2b2f35e43cb3fabdc20","citations":["euclid-6-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if four straight lines be proportional, the rectangle contained by the extremes is equal to the rectangle contained by the means. [[VI. 16](/principles/euclid-6-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果四条直线是成比例, 由极端形成的矩形 等于由手段形成的矩形。 [[VI. 16](/principles/euclid-6-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-17.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-6-17","revisionId":"euclid-6-17@raw-21415b156e72ad10","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f3ea01958a5b2ef107ee6234f5dd83c372fbc57845461ee8d8d8e7d01c748c9b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the rectangle A, C is equal to the rectangle B, D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,矩形 A,C等于矩形 B,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-17.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-6-17","revisionId":"euclid-6-17@raw-21415b156e72ad10","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a3d9bf24f66e6eee71e373e877cdd174241aa21682bbaab567e824e16a384667","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the rectangle B, D is the square on B, for B is equal to D; therefore the rectangle contained by A, C is equal to the square on B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,矩形 B,D是B的正方形,B等于D;因此,B的矩形是A,C等于B的正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-17.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-6-17","revisionId":"euclid-6-17@raw-21415b156e72ad10","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8cec2d8ecbd13a72371556b44cdd95d24859cca40a734c9ae4db73de2d31491b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let the rectangle A, C be equal to the square on B; I say that, as A is to B, so is B to C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其次,矩形 A,C等于B的正方形;我说,A对B的比等于B对C的比；A 与 B 之比等于 B 与 C 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-17.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-6-17","revisionId":"euclid-6-17@raw-21415b156e72ad10","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"75eb21d2993dc0e98a25f9644d8e8392ed0fdcb8e47a3644f3a2975a6df103ec","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, with the same construction, since the rectangle A, C is equal to the square on B, while the square on B is the rectangle B, D, for B is equal to D, therefore the rectangle A, C is equal to the rectangle B, D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在同一建筑中,矩形 A,C等于B的正方形,B的正方形等于矩形 B,B的矩形,D等于D,因此矩形 A,C等于矩形 B,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-17.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-6-17","revisionId":"euclid-6-17@raw-21415b156e72ad10","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aacf303f8ddc08b77586700403be6a1c3e00ea99f996ee2908bb5c186b4dd7f3","citations":["euclid-6-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if the rectangle contained by the extremes be equal to that contained by the means, the four straight lines are proportional. [[VI. 16](/principles/euclid-6-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果矩形的极端形成 等于由手段形成的, 4直线是成比例。 [[VI. 16](/principles/euclid-6-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-17.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-6-17","revisionId":"euclid-6-17@raw-21415b156e72ad10","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c84b1b859598f5dfb51eaef8013a984f8f79b7dd45b1b9b9f01863cbcf139c1f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as A is to B, so is D to C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A比B等于D比C；A 与 B 之比等于 D 与 C 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-17.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-6-17","revisionId":"euclid-6-17@raw-21415b156e72ad10","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"65726a3c1bc490ef9e6fb20c4ff7c588c78f3cc1d7b99952f54788d1411bb9eb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But B is equal to D; therefore, as A is to B, so is B to C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但B等于D;因此,A比B等于B比C；A 与 B 之比等于 B 与 C 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-17.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-6-17","revisionId":"euclid-6-17@raw-21415b156e72ad10","order":12,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-17.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-6-17","revisionId":"euclid-6-17@raw-21415b156e72ad10","order":13,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0f32459e27d5f5de70977fdfcf720f056e45965d16d2c55bfd1eb24013484909","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"三直线为连比例即首尾两线矩内直角形与中线上直角方形等首尾线矩内直角形与中线上直角方形等即三线为连比例"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"三条直线是连接比，即首尾两条直线内的矩形等于中线上的正方形。头尾直线内的矩形时距等于中线上的正方形，即三条直线是连续比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-17.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-6-17","revisionId":"euclid-6-17@raw-21415b156e72ad10","order":14,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0c4260da7e945fc2fd8bf4b31cfc2f9219787bd763c65f336d89bac475bb4be6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"先解曰：甲乙戊己乙丙三线为连比例者甲乙与戊己若戊己与乙丙也而甲乙丙丁为甲乙乙丙首尾线矩内直角形戊己庚辛为戊己上直角方形题言甲丙戊庚两形等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先，说明如下：甲乙戊己乙丙，三条直线按比例连接。如果 甲乙 和 戊己 是 戊己 和 乙丙，并且 甲乙丙丁 是 甲乙乙丙，首尾两条直线是矩形内的时距，戊己庚辛 是 戊己 上的正方形。命题说明：甲丙戊庚 两种形状，相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-17.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-6-17","revisionId":"euclid-6-17@raw-21415b156e72ad10","order":15,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1c5c9eee85296e58196aedd65749fdc9edaa6d9bd7b333d1440f82b9b013a930","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试作己庚线与戊己等即甲乙乙丙己庚戊己为比例等等者谓甲乙与戊己若己庚与乙丙也则戊己己庚矩内直角形〈即戊己上直角方形〉与甲乙乙丙首尾线矩内之甲丙形等矣〈本篇十六〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：试验线 己庚 和 戊己，即 甲乙乙丙己庚戊己 为比例，相等。甲乙 和 戊己，如果 己庚 和 乙丙，那么 戊己己庚 是时距内的矩形，〈即戊己上正方形〉 和 甲乙乙丙 与 甲丙 在首尾直线的时距内相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-17.historical.4","contentId":"euclid-6-17","revisionId":"euclid-6-17@raw-21415b156e72ad10","order":16,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"52437471c101933c02d0ae773cdd918fc69e816cf3531aed0f3410ab67e73d08","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"后解曰：甲丙直角形与戊庚直角方形等题言甲乙与戊己之比例若戊己与乙丙"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"解释如下：甲丙，矩形和 戊庚，正方形等命题。解释 甲乙 与 戊己 的比。如果 戊己 和 乙丙"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-17.historical.5","contentId":"euclid-6-17","revisionId":"euclid-6-17@raw-21415b156e72ad10","order":17,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9423ab455d461b1ad3872613c8baad4815bc56414732f1b4e90eb3055f507eb3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：甲丙戊庚既皆直角形即甲乙与戊己之比例若己庚与乙丙也〈本篇十六〉而己庚与乙丙亦若等己庚之戊己与乙丙〈五卷七〉则甲乙与戊己若戊己与乙丙矣"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：甲丙戊庚 是矩形，也就是说，甲乙 与 戊己 的比，如果 己庚 和 乙丙 也是 〈本篇十六〉，而 己庚 和 乙丙 也相等 乙丙〈五卷七〉，则 甲乙 和 戊己 是 戊己 和 乙丙。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-17.historical.6","contentId":"euclid-6-17","revisionId":"euclid-6-17@raw-21415b156e72ad10","order":18,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d89e159d33e47a19a6a5a3f972c48a78b21db3b34827c221e5207c84f50d9c37","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"注曰：若平行斜方形而等角亦同此论如上图系凡直线上直角方形与他两线所作矩内直角形等即此线为他两线之中率何者依上后论甲乙乙丙矩内直角形与戊己上直角方形等即可推甲乙与戊己若戊己与乙丙而戊己为甲乙乙丙之中率故"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"注意：如果一个正方形与一个角相等的斜线平行，则同样适用于相同论证。如上图所示，正方形与另外两条线之间矩形内部的面积相等，意味着该线是其他两条线的中比例。根据前述讨论，内部矩形 甲乙乙丙 与 戊己 上的正方形相等，可以推导出 甲乙 和 戊己。如果 戊己 和 乙丙 是 甲乙乙丙 的中比例，"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-17.source","contentId":"euclid-6-17","revisionId":"euclid-6-17@raw-21415b156e72ad10","order":19,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"79ce7c73809d6d42b7d6cfd0024011271f7b69ea75dbf95349210ff9654e5f1d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.17/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.17\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-6-17:euclid-6-16:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-17","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-17.proof.2","euclid-6-17.proof.7"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-16","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.17","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.17/","sourceLabel":"VI. 16"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-25:euclid-6-17:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-25","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-25.proo